<title>USA: Premark International Inc Q4 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Premark International Inc Q4 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.48		    $0.34</p>
<p> Oper net		   32,000		   21,600</p>
<p> Revs			610,000		  598,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   66,900		   63,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.87		    $1.24</p>
<p> Oper net		   56,700		   78,900</p>
<p> Revs		    2,267,600		2,213,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   65,000		   63,800</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year oper shr includes net after-tax charge on loss from sale of Hartco of $38.6 million, or $0.60/shr.</p>
<p>1996 year oper shr excludes income from discontinued operations of $62.2 million, or $0.96/shr.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 oper shr excludes income from discontinued operations of $55.6 million, or $0.88/shr.</p>
<p>1995 year oper shr excludes income from discontinued operations of $158.7 million, or $2.48/shr.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
